<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n57113" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῆλον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>shaft</i> of an arrow,
			<i>arrow</i>, only pl., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῆλα θεοῖο</span>
			<i>the shafts</i> of Apollo, as the cause of sudden death, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				1.53
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				383
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πιφαυσκόμενος τὰ ἃ
			κῆλα</span>, of Zeus during a snowstorm, <i><span class="en">
				12.280
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεροπὴν καὶ αἰθαλόεντα</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεραυνόν, κῆλα Διός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Th.</u>
					708
				</span></i>
			: metaph., [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φόρμιγγος] κῆλα καὶ δαιμόνων θέλγει
					φρένας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					1.12
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρικώδεα κῆλα πίφαυσκον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>A.</u>
					10
				</span></i>
			:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κήλεα</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νηῶν,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κᾶλα</span>
			, ships' <i>timbers</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				206
			</span></i> (s.v.l.).</div>
